    "detailed_description": "- Game Description<br />\r\nCombine awesome skills to win against waves of enemies!<br />\r\nSkill Random Defense is a casual defense game that combines 60 skills to block enemies.<br />\r\nCombine the optimal skills using the skills you have.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Tips<br />\r\n1. Acquire skill materials by clicking the skill acquisition button on the bottom left or pressing F1.<br />\r\n2. Combine high-level skills with the collected skill materials.<br />\r\n3. Click on a skill or press QWER to select it, then press Z to combine skills.<br />\r\n4. You can combine skill materials by clicking on them in the skill pop-up window or selecting the materials through QWER.",
